WEBVTT

00:01.044 --> 00:03.560
I'm taking the Founder right now!

00:03.644 --> 00:05.408
Eren!

00:11.844 --> 00:14.293
Wait. Could that be him?

00:14.377 --> 00:16.575
Is that Ackermann?

00:20.978 --> 00:22.760
What the hell?

00:22.844 --> 00:24.875
Can't you see I'm a Titan?

00:26.778 --> 00:28.960
Are a bunch of humans

00:29.044 --> 00:30.560
really about to

00:30.644 --> 00:32.708
come and kill me?

00:34.778 --> 00:37.493
No. They're not humans.

00:37.577 --> 00:39.308
They're devils!

00:44.578 --> 00:46.960
Behind us!
Fall back! Take cover!

00:47.044 --> 00:49.041
Shit! I can't shake 'em!

01:02.978 --> 01:05.308
Damn it. We took too long.

01:06.844 --> 01:08.694
The Cart Titan's here.

01:08.778 --> 01:10.360
Pieck!

01:10.444 --> 01:12.275
Made it just in time.

01:13.111 --> 01:14.760
My heavy machine gun armament

01:14.844 --> 01:17.494
is a perfect counter to their ODM gear.

01:17.578 --> 01:20.208
It was worth the time
it took to equip it.

01:36.511 --> 01:37.742
Eren!

01:51.912 --> 01:55.241
It's him. The Beast Titan.

01:56.778 --> 01:58.241
It's Zeke!

02:06.978 --> 02:10.508
Eren Jaeger. I'll kill you!

02:18.043 --> 02:19.960
Kill all of them.

02:20.043 --> 02:21.809
Let none escape.

02:22.912 --> 02:25.709
Stay alive. That's an order.

04:52.607 --> 04:53.771
What the...?

05:12.140 --> 05:16.990
No way. Is that... Mr. Kruger?

05:17.074 --> 05:19.971
No. It's Eren Jaeger.

05:21.674 --> 05:22.838
Damn you!

05:28.940 --> 05:31.790
Wait, Vice Chief Braun!

05:31.874 --> 05:33.437
Hey, it's me!

05:35.940 --> 05:36.990
Vice Chief!

05:37.074 --> 05:39.838
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

05:44.740 --> 05:48.056
He's still alive.

05:48.140 --> 05:49.990
But he's unconscious.

05:50.074 --> 05:51.523
His body should be healing itself

05:51.607 --> 05:53.470
with the Power of the Titans.

05:54.340 --> 05:59.005
At least, as long as
he has the will to... live...

06:01.340 --> 06:04.124
I can't take this anymore.

06:04.207 --> 06:06.204
Please just kill me.

06:12.207 --> 06:15.638
Sit tight, sir. I'll get help.

06:17.874 --> 06:19.056
You know, there're people out there

06:19.139 --> 06:20.856
who aren't enemies.

06:20.940 --> 06:22.189
Udo and Gabi.

06:22.273 --> 06:23.189
Zofia.

06:23.273 --> 06:25.137
All of us are on your side.

06:26.074 --> 06:28.738
Just hang in there. Okay?

06:31.674 --> 06:32.838
Incoming!

06:37.207 --> 06:38.590
That bastard's gonna pay!

06:38.674 --> 06:40.123
Wait! Get back!

06:40.207 --> 06:42.071
I'll kill him here and now!

06:45.008 --> 06:47.656
Good work. Continue to cover
the War Chief's six.

06:47.740 --> 06:49.656
Right!

06:49.740 --> 06:50.656
Just above us!

06:50.740 --> 06:51.871
Bad angle!

06:57.273 --> 06:59.656
Thanks, Galliard!
You saved our butts.

06:59.740 --> 07:00.456
'Preciate the help!

07:00.540 --> 07:01.389
Nice one, Pock!

07:01.473 --> 07:03.590
That was close! Thanks!

07:03.674 --> 07:04.790
Stay on your toes.

07:04.874 --> 07:06.856
I ran into Ackermann a minute ago.

07:06.940 --> 07:08.856
He's still hiding nearby.

07:08.940 --> 07:10.256
This is bad.

07:10.340 --> 07:12.656
Porco! The War Hammer!

07:12.740 --> 07:13.704
Huh?

07:19.874 --> 07:23.189
You formed a crystal shell like Annie's.

07:23.273 --> 07:26.590
It's clearly much harder than my teeth.

07:26.674 --> 07:30.055
But I know that you've spent
the last of your strength.

07:30.139 --> 07:31.790
If you had any left,

07:31.874 --> 07:33.790
you would've used the War Hammer's power

07:33.874 --> 07:36.123
to pierce my neck by now.

07:36.207 --> 07:39.471
You don't have any moves left to play.

07:41.273 --> 07:43.805
Looks like I've outlasted you.

07:51.607 --> 07:54.790
Shit. After all that,

07:54.874 --> 07:57.871
the bastard still has more fight in him?

07:58.808 --> 08:02.055
But if we can take him down,
the Founder's ours.

08:02.139 --> 08:04.256
What are you so worried about, Pock?

08:04.340 --> 08:05.724
Huh?

08:05.808 --> 08:08.123
There isn't any need for us to rush this.

08:08.207 --> 08:09.656
We have control of the battlefield

08:09.740 --> 08:12.256
and its surroundings.

08:12.340 --> 08:15.523
All we need to do now is tighten our net.

08:15.607 --> 08:18.256
The enemy took to the
field wearing ODM gear.

08:18.340 --> 08:22.055
So they have a limited supply
of fuel and ammunition.

08:22.139 --> 08:26.537
In short, they're stranded in
enemy territory with no support.

08:27.340 --> 08:29.189
And the incoming Marleyan reinforcements

08:29.273 --> 08:31.189
have already surrounded the zone,

08:31.273 --> 08:33.856
so there's no escape.

08:33.940 --> 08:36.055
Paradis never stood
a chance against Marley

08:36.139 --> 08:38.056
in a proper war, anyway.

08:38.140 --> 08:40.856
They don't have enough
people or resources.

08:40.940 --> 08:43.523
That's why it's so crucial
we take out the Founder!

08:43.607 --> 08:45.590
Once they lose the power
to start the Rumbling,

08:45.674 --> 08:46.856
they'll be helpless.

08:46.940 --> 08:49.256
It's the ace up their sleeve,
and it's right in front of us!

08:49.340 --> 08:51.056
Which makes it that much more important

08:51.140 --> 08:53.656
that we proceed with caution.

08:53.740 --> 08:55.189
For the time being, at least,

08:55.273 --> 08:58.724
focus on protecting the
War Chief from Ackermann.

08:58.808 --> 09:03.137
Astute as ever, Pieck.
You're exactly right.

09:13.607 --> 09:15.989
I'm not here to fight you, Eren.

09:16.073 --> 09:18.738
I have another opponent.

09:26.808 --> 09:29.189
Let's have our rematch, Levi.

09:29.273 --> 09:32.656
Come on. Show yourself.

09:32.740 --> 09:34.905
You're running out of time, right?

09:43.340 --> 09:45.656
Okay. If there's anyone
who can deal with this mess,

09:45.740 --> 09:46.790
it's War Chief Zeke.

09:46.874 --> 09:48.137
Grice?

09:49.207 --> 09:52.656
Commander Magath! Please
sir, listen! By the stage...

09:52.740 --> 09:53.856
What are you doing?

09:53.939 --> 09:55.856
You haven't been injured, have you?

09:55.939 --> 09:57.856
No. I'm fine!

09:57.939 --> 09:59.790
Then you need to get
the hell out of here.

09:59.874 --> 10:02.856
Sir. Vice Chief Braun
is underground behind the stage.

10:02.939 --> 10:04.856
He's not moving:
It's like he's in a coma.

10:04.939 --> 10:06.256
What happened?

10:06.340 --> 10:10.523
It's my fault. He saved my life.

10:10.607 --> 10:12.856
Who'd he save you from?

10:12.939 --> 10:16.671
It was Eren Jaeger.

10:24.808 --> 10:25.857
Hurry and dock!

10:25.940 --> 10:29.056
We need to reinforce the
troops in Liberio quickly!

10:29.140 --> 10:33.123
I'm told that they're taking
devastating losses there! Huh?

10:33.207 --> 10:35.590
Hey! Can't you see
the fleet around you?

10:35.674 --> 10:38.256
Get that fishing boat outta here!

10:38.340 --> 10:39.671
Hey!

10:43.207 --> 10:44.171
Huh?

11:04.273 --> 11:06.638
Our... ships...

11:10.073 --> 11:11.256
Snap out of it!

11:11.340 --> 11:13.123
Get as far away from here as you can.

11:13.207 --> 11:14.790
But, Commander. What was...

11:14.873 --> 11:18.137
They took out our port.
And only one Titan can...

11:19.939 --> 11:22.190
It looks like they have the Colossal now.

11:22.274 --> 11:24.590
They didn't just kill Bertholdt.

11:24.674 --> 11:26.190
They took his Titan.

11:26.274 --> 11:28.923
Vicious bastards!

11:29.007 --> 11:30.524
It seems they didn't barge in here

11:30.608 --> 11:33.524
without a plan after all!

11:33.608 --> 11:36.190
Give us your worst, you damn devils.

11:36.274 --> 11:38.855
Your plans'll mean jack shit
if I take the Founder

11:38.939 --> 11:40.705
before you can act on them!

11:42.073 --> 11:44.590
Is that the other Ackermann?

11:44.674 --> 11:46.171
Doesn't matter!

11:50.807 --> 11:52.855
War Chief!
They're coming up on our right.

12:13.073 --> 12:14.638
- - Zeke!
- -Get down!

12:21.207 --> 12:22.656
No way...

12:22.740 --> 12:24.871
Pieck! We've got incoming!

12:47.340 --> 12:48.190
What happened?

12:48.274 --> 12:49.524
Hey. Carlo!

12:49.608 --> 12:52.904
Come on, say something! Carlo!

12:59.140 --> 13:01.656
You'll pay for that!

13:01.739 --> 13:03.904
I think it's your turn to pay.

13:09.873 --> 13:11.737
Fire! Hurry!

13:16.274 --> 13:17.538
Pieck!

13:19.074 --> 13:20.638
My men!

13:35.207 --> 13:36.605
Pieck!

14:32.885 --> 14:37.182
Is this... the same view
that you had, Bertholdt?

14:38.217 --> 14:40.133
It must be.

14:40.217 --> 14:42.867
No, please. Don't kill her.

14:42.951 --> 14:45.015
Come on! Finish it!

14:48.017 --> 14:51.149
Don't shoot! Leave Pieck alone!

15:02.752 --> 15:04.534
The shot missed.

15:04.618 --> 15:05.933
What happened?

15:06.017 --> 15:07.867
Did the steam knock it off course?

15:07.951 --> 15:11.267
Or did I hesitate because of that kid?

15:11.351 --> 15:14.933
Pieck!

15:15.017 --> 15:17.668
The Cart Titan's still alive!

15:17.752 --> 15:19.534
Run away...

15:19.618 --> 15:21.267
I can't!

15:21.351 --> 15:23.948
Hurry, Falco.

15:26.017 --> 15:28.001
Keep Pieck covered!

15:28.085 --> 15:30.067
Eat lead, you damn devils!

15:30.151 --> 15:32.134
Hey, Braun! Give Grice a hand!

15:32.218 --> 15:33.915
Understood, sir!

15:35.752 --> 15:37.201
Fall back! Take cover!

15:37.285 --> 15:39.249
This way. Move!

15:41.752 --> 15:43.133
We're dropping like flies.

15:43.217 --> 15:45.133
First War Chief and now Pieck?

15:45.217 --> 15:46.933
Damn it. Damn it!

15:47.017 --> 15:47.734
Damn it!

15:47.817 --> 15:51.982
Damn you!

16:16.485 --> 16:20.315
He's fast. Much faster
than Ymir's Jaw Titan.

16:23.017 --> 16:27.682
So this is the power
of the Jaw. I see.

16:28.618 --> 16:32.534
It's horrible.
Her body can't heal fast enough.

16:32.618 --> 16:35.534
But she has the Power
of the Titans, so why?

16:35.618 --> 16:38.801
The Cart Titan isn't exactly
known for its toughness.

16:38.885 --> 16:41.001
It's not like the Armored Titan.

16:41.085 --> 16:43.134
Wait, where's Reiner?

16:43.218 --> 16:44.134
Is he somewhere close?

16:44.218 --> 16:46.267
You told the Commander
that Eren Jaeger got to him

16:46.351 --> 16:47.933
and knocked him out.

16:48.017 --> 16:50.334
But we can wake him up, right?

16:50.418 --> 16:51.733
I'm not so sure.

16:51.817 --> 16:54.334
He's still underground behind the plaza.

16:54.418 --> 16:57.933
But um... Listen.

16:58.017 --> 16:59.134
I'm sorry, but I feel like maybe

16:59.218 --> 17:01.334
we should let Reiner sit this one out.

17:01.418 --> 17:04.267
What are you saying?

17:04.351 --> 17:06.468
We need Reiner to fight.

17:06.552 --> 17:08.134
To avenge Udo and Zofia

17:08.218 --> 17:10.915
and all the other people
those devils killed.

17:18.418 --> 17:20.067
Hey. Get back here.

17:20.151 --> 17:21.534
Wait, don't go to the windows!

17:21.618 --> 17:23.848
You'll give our location away!

17:25.218 --> 17:26.215
Huh?

17:27.418 --> 17:29.282
Commander!

17:48.351 --> 17:51.334
Commander. I just
spotted the signal lights.

17:51.418 --> 17:52.334
That's a relief.

17:52.418 --> 17:54.067
At least we know that some of the mission

17:54.151 --> 17:55.733
went according to plan.

17:55.817 --> 17:58.134
Whelp. We're counting
on you, Onyankopon.

17:58.218 --> 18:00.534
I've got this, Hange.
Don't worry.

18:00.618 --> 18:03.468
Cross the Internment Zone
at low speed and altitude.

18:03.552 --> 18:06.934
Our troops'll be able to get up
to us with their ODM gear.

18:07.018 --> 18:08.867
We can really only fly through once,

18:08.951 --> 18:11.534
so any stragglers who
miss us are out of luck.

18:11.617 --> 18:14.733
Or in luck, if we get
shot out of the sky.

18:14.817 --> 18:17.534
You came up with one
hell of a reckless plan.

18:17.617 --> 18:20.934
What? You get possessed by
Erwin's ghost or something?

18:21.018 --> 18:22.933
To be honest, I wish I had.

18:23.017 --> 18:26.134
At a time like this,
I could use his strength.

18:26.218 --> 18:28.867
We're dancing on a
knife's edge yet again.

18:28.951 --> 18:31.933
This has to work, 'cause if
we lose Eren and the others,

18:32.017 --> 18:34.382
then we have no future in this world.

18:37.817 --> 18:39.134
Jean. It's here.

18:39.218 --> 18:41.134
Yeah. It's right on time.

18:41.218 --> 18:42.067
Don't tell me they're gonna

18:42.151 --> 18:44.334
try and escape on that thing?

18:44.418 --> 18:45.982
Not happening!

18:48.418 --> 18:49.349
Shit!

19:22.817 --> 19:24.115
What's he...?

19:31.285 --> 19:32.882
H-Hey!

19:37.551 --> 19:39.249
What are you doing?

19:43.151 --> 19:44.282
Stop.

19:48.352 --> 19:52.082
Stop it! Stop it!

20:01.617 --> 20:07.982
Please! Stop!

20:23.352 --> 20:25.134
What just happened...?

20:25.218 --> 20:27.533
The War Hammer Titan got eaten.

20:27.617 --> 20:30.249
And the Jaw Titan is next.

20:38.151 --> 20:39.733
Then they've won.

20:39.817 --> 20:42.082
All our Warriors are finished.

20:50.617 --> 20:53.467
Wait. Not all.

20:53.551 --> 20:57.134
Reiner!

20:57.218 --> 21:01.334
Help us!

21:01.418 --> 21:02.134
Hey.

21:02.218 --> 21:04.334
You have to save Galliard!

21:04.418 --> 21:07.068
He's about to get eaten!

21:07.152 --> 21:12.134
You hear me? Help us!

21:12.218 --> 21:14.934
Reiner!

21:15.018 --> 21:16.682
Shut up.

21:18.085 --> 21:20.334
Just be quiet.

21:20.418 --> 21:21.934
Reiner!

21:22.018 --> 21:25.201
Reiner!

21:25.285 --> 21:27.334
Reiner!

21:27.418 --> 21:31.467
Please. Leave me alone.

21:31.551 --> 21:33.067
- -Help us!
- -Reiner!

21:33.151 --> 21:34.334
Cut it out, you brats!

21:34.417 --> 21:38.182
The enemy soldiers will
hear you! Stop shouting!

21:39.417 --> 21:43.349
Why won't any of you...

22:01.285 --> 22:05.849
just let me... die in peace?

23:41.341 --> 23:44.990
Its strength spent,
the Armored Titan falls.

23:45.074 --> 23:47.724
Furious at the destruction
of her hometown,

23:47.808 --> 23:52.057
Gabi picks up a gun and
sets out to take revenge.

23:52.141 --> 23:54.971
Next episode:
"Assassin's Bullet."
